    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>cluster-outline-recipe-clustering-grid-positions · 10×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 2560 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-cluster-and-outline-recipe-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect><rect x=\"81\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"4\"></rect><rect x=\"101\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"5\"></rect><rect x=\"121\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"6\"></rect><rect x=\"141\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"7\"></rect><rect x=\"161\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"8\"></rect><rect x=\"181\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"9\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-cluster-and-outline-recipe-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const parametersOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; parameters: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const gridPositionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; gridPositions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const rowIdsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; rowIds: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const GEOGRAPHIC: bool = false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const SPHERE_RADIUS: f32 = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const DEGREES_PER_RADIAN: f32 = 57.2957795130823;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const RADIANS_PER_DEGREE: f32 = 0.0174532925199433;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const COLUMNS: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">const ROWS: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">const NOISE: u32 = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">const CELL_MARGIN: f32 = 1.0009765625;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">struct Lattice {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  valid: bool,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  minimumX: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  minimumY: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  maximumX: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  maximumY: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  cellWidth: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  cellHeight: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  columns: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  rows: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  epsilonSquared: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  minimumPoints: u32\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">fn isFiniteFloat(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">fn readLattice() -&gt; Lattice {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  var lattice: Lattice;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  lattice.cellWidth = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  lattice.cellHeight = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  lattice.columns = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  lattice.rows = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  lattice.epsilonSquared = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  lattice.minimumPoints = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  let minimumX = parameters[parametersOffset];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  let minimumY = parameters[parametersOffset + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  let maximumX = parameters[parametersOffset + 2u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  let maximumY = parameters[parametersOffset + 3u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  let epsilon = parameters[parametersOffset + 4u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  let minimumPointsValue = parameters[parametersOffset + 5u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  let width = maximumX - minimumX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  let height = maximumY - minimumY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  // Planar: neighbors satisfy dx^2 + dy^2 &lt;= epsilon^2, so a cell must be epsilon wide. Geographic:\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  // the haversine term of neighbors is at most sin^2(epsilon / (2 R)).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  var epsilonSquared = epsilon * epsilon;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  var cellStepX = epsilon * CELL_MARGIN;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  var cellStepY = cellStepX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  var inRange = true;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  if (GEOGRAPHIC) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">    let halfAngle = 0.5 * epsilon / SPHERE_RADIUS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">    let sinHalf = sin(halfAngle);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">    epsilonSquared = sinHalf * sinHalf;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">    cellStepY = 2.0 * halfAngle * DEGREES_PER_RADIAN * CELL_MARGIN;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">    let cosLatitude = cos(max(abs(minimumY), abs(maximumY)) * RADIANS_PER_DEGREE);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">    let ratio = sinHalf / max(cosLatitude, 1e-6);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">    cellStepX = select(2.0 * asin(ratio) * DEGREES_PER_RADIAN * CELL_MARGIN, 360.0, ratio &gt;= 0.99);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">    inRange = minimumX &gt;= -180.0 &amp;&amp; maximumX &lt;= 180.0 &amp;&amp; minimumY &gt;= -90.0 &amp;&amp; maximumY &lt;= 90.0 &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">      halfAngle &lt; 1.5707963;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  lattice.valid = inRange &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">    isFiniteFloat(minimumX) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(minimumY) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(maximumX) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">    isFiniteFloat(maximumY) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(epsilon) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(minimumPointsValue) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">    isFiniteFloat(width) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(height) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(epsilonSquared) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">    isFiniteFloat(cellStepX) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(cellStepY) &amp;&amp; epsilon &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp; width &gt;= 0.0 &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">    height &gt;= 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">  if (!lattice.valid) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">    return lattice;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">  lattice.minimumX = minimumX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">  lattice.minimumY = minimumY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  lattice.maximumX = maximumX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">  lattice.maximumY = maximumY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">  lattice.cellWidth = max(width / f32(COLUMNS), cellStepX);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">  lattice.cellHeight = max(height / f32(ROWS), cellStepY);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">  lattice.columns = min(COLUMNS - 1u, u32(floor(width / lattice.cellWidth))) + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  lattice.rows = min(ROWS - 1u, u32(floor(height / lattice.cellHeight))) + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">  lattice.epsilonSquared = epsilonSquared;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">  lattice.minimumPoints = u32(max(minimumPointsValue, 0.0));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">  return lattice;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">fn isWithinEpsilon(lattice: Lattice, ax: f32, ay: f32, bx: f32, by: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">  let deltaX = bx - ax;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">  let deltaY = by - ay;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">  return deltaX * deltaX + deltaY * deltaY &lt;= lattice.epsilonSquared;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">fn isPointValid(lattice: Lattice, x: f32, y: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">  return lattice.valid &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(x) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(y) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">    x &gt;= lattice.minimumX &amp;&amp; x &lt;= lattice.maximumX &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">    y &gt;= lattice.minimumY &amp;&amp; y &lt;= lattice.maximumY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">fn getCellColumn(lattice: Lattice, x: f32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">  return min(u32(floor((x - lattice.minimumX) / lattice.cellWidth)), lattice.columns - 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">fn getCellRow(lattice: Lattice, y: f32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">  return min(u32(floor((y - lattice.minimumY) / lattice.cellHeight)), lattice.rows - 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">fn getGridUnitPosition(lattice: Lattice, x: f32, y: f32) -&gt; vec2f {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">  let width = max(lattice.maximumX, lattice.minimumX + lattice.cellWidth * f32(COLUMNS)) - lattice.minimumX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">  let height = max(lattice.maximumY, lattice.minimumY + lattice.cellHeight * f32(ROWS)) - lattice.minimumY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">  return vec2f((x - lattice.minimumX) / width, (y - lattice.minimumY) / height);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"124\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"125\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">  _ = &amp;parameters;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">  _ = &amp;gridPositions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">  _ = &amp;rowIds;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">  let lattice = readLattice();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">  let x = positions[positionsOffset + index * 2u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">  let y = positions[positionsOffset + index * 2u + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">  let valid = isPointValid(lattice, x, y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"146\">  let invalid = bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(0x7fc00000u | (index &amp; 0u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"147\">  let unit = getGridUnitPosition(lattice, x, y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"148\">  gridPositions[gridPositionsOffset + index * 2u] = select(invalid, unit.x, valid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"149\">  gridPositions[gridPositionsOffset + index * 2u + 1u] = select(invalid, unit.y, valid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"150\">  rowIds[rowIdsOffset + index] = index;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"151\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"observations\">observations</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>parameters<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"clustering-parameters\">clustering-parameters</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>gridPositions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"cluster-outline-recipe-clustering-grid-positions\">cluster-outline-recipe-clustering-grid-positions</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>rowIds<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" dat